
# The repository is private, so the Fab assets are in Git (Git LFS). See docs/Assets.md.
# Only the original wood pack stays out: it is 2.8 GB, and the game uses 1K copies of the 16 woods
# (Content/Kakurenbo/Wood, made by Tools/ImportSourceArt.ps1 from SourceArt/Wood).
KakurenboIncremental/Content/Substance_Materials_Vol1_Wood/
# The mansion packs (Fab) stay out too: the game uses copies of the few pieces it needs.
# Medieval Room Kit -> SourceArt/MedievalRoomKit, StylizedKitchen and Isometric-Interiors -> SourceArt/FabProps
# (Tools/ExtractFabProps.py), imported by Tools/ImportSourceArt.ps1 into Content/Kakurenbo/Mansion.
KakurenboIncremental/Content/StylizedKitchen/
KakurenboIncremental/Content/Isometric-Interiors/
KakurenboIncremental/Content/Medieval Room Kit/
KakurenboIncremental/Content/Medieval Room Kit Textures/
# Editor-only per-user folders
KakurenboIncremental/Content/Developers/
KakurenboIncremental/Content/Collections/

# Packaged game (Tools/Package.ps1)
/Packaged/
